<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the U.S dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the U.S dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued 230 million American-style call and put warrants, in 23 equal tranches, on the U.S dollar/mark exchange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   06.FEB.97		MIN EXER LOT  100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1.6428 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
